/E (Reflexo Pvt. Ltd., a four-week, industry-oriented training program focused on building practical competence in Computer-Aided Design using SolidWorks, AutoCAD, Onshape, Tinkercad and FreeCAD. The internship was structured around progressive, lecture-linked assignments that moved from fundamental 2D sketching to advanced part modelling, and finally to multi-part assembly design with production-ready engineering drawings.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
